{"seq":15,"slug":"developer-relations","title":"开发者关系","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":4,"docCount":15,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/developer-relations","rating":{"composite":3.67,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.8,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"开发者关系\">开发者关系</h1><p>开发者关系（Developer Relations，简称 DevRel）是面向开发者群体的非传统营销与产品职能——通过技术内容、社区运营、活动布道、文档与示例代码，帮助开发者理解、采用、并成功落地一个平台、API、SDK 或开源项目。它由 Sun Microsystems 90 年代的 Java Evangelist、Google Developer Relations 2005 年成型、Stripe / Twilio / Vercel / Supabase 在 2010-2020 把 DevRel 推向商业核心，成为 PLG（Product-Led Growth）时代最重要的获客与留存通道之一。DevRel 工程师跨越 Marketing、Product、Engineering、Customer Success 四方，既要写代码 demo、又要上台演讲、还要运营社区——是典型的 T 型人才岗位。本 Hub 从基础（DevRel 定义 / 开发者画像 / DevRel vs Marketing vs Pre-sales / 组织模型）、内容（技术写作 / 演讲 / 文档示例 / 视频直播）、社区（线上论坛 / 线下活动 / 大使项目 / 开源 stewardship）、项目与度量（开发者计划 / 度量与 OKR / 反馈闭环）四个维度，给希望转 DevRel、组建 DevRel 团队、或评估 DevRel 投入的工程师与管理者一条工程化路径。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[开发者关系 DevRel] --&gt; B[1. DevRel 基础]&#10;    A --&gt; C[2. 内容与教育]&#10;    A --&gt; D[3. 社区建设]&#10;    A --&gt; E[4. 项目与度量]&#10;    B --&gt; F[定义 / 画像 / 组织 / 边界]&#10;    C --&gt; G[写作 / 演讲 / 文档 / 视频]&#10;    D --&gt; H[论坛 / 活动 / 大使 / 开源]&#10;    E --&gt; I[Programs / OKR / 反馈闭环]\">graph TD\n    A[开发者关系 DevRel] --&gt; B[1. DevRel 基础]\n    A --&gt; C[2. 内容与教育]\n    A --&gt; D[3. 社区建设]\n    A --&gt; E[4. 项目与度量]\n    B --&gt; F[定义 / 画像 / 组织 / 边界]\n    C --&gt; G[写作 / 演讲 / 文档 / 视频]\n    D --&gt; H[论坛 / 活动 / 大使 / 开源]\n    E --&gt; I[Programs / OKR / 反馈闭环]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>核心概念</th>\n<th>实战代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DevRel 基础</td>\n<td>定义、开发者画像、组织模型、与 PMM 边界</td>\n<td>Stripe、Twilio、Vercel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容与教育</td>\n<td>Technical writing、talk、tutorial、video</td>\n<td>DigitalOcean、freeCodeCamp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社区建设</td>\n<td>Discord / Forum、meetup、ambassador、OSS</td>\n<td>GitHub、Supabase、HashiCorp</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>项目与度量</td>\n<td>Developer programs、metrics/OKR、feedback</td>\n<td>AWS、Microsoft、MongoDB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>学完本 Hub 你将能定义 DevRel 在公司中的定位与 KPI、design 开发者旅程从 awareness 到 advocacy、build content engine 与 community flywheel、为 DevRel 团队设定可衡量的度量体系。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"devrel-foundations","title":"DevRel 基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/developer-relations/devrel-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-devrel","title":"什么是 DevRel","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/developer-relations/devrel-foundations/what-is-devrel"},{"seq":2,"slug":"developer-personas-and-journey","title":"开发者画像与旅程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/developer-relations/devrel-foundations/developer-personas-and-journey"},{"seq":3,"slug":"advocacy-vs-marketing-vs-pre-sales","title":"技术布道、营销与售前的边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/developer-relations/devrel-foundations/advocacy-vs-marketing-vs-pre-sales"},{"seq":4,"slug":"devrel-org-models","title":"开发者关系组织模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/developer-relations/devrel-foundations/devrel-org-models"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"content-and-education","title":"内容与教育","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/developer-relations/content-and-education","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"technical-writing-for-developers","title":"面向开发者的技术写作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/developer-relations/content-and-education/technical-writing-for-developers"},{"seq":2,"slug":"public-speaking-and-talks","title":"演讲与会议演讲","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/developer-relations/content-and-education/public-speaking-and-talks"},{"seq":3,"slug":"docs-tutorials-and-samples","title":"文档、教程与示例代码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/developer-relations/content-and-education/docs-tutorials-and-samples